From 14b8cd78facda7fa1269ed59fc1db036e976a17c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: claude <claude@example.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 21:12:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Backend: async Store, PostgreSQL adapter, RLS, migration
 runner, HTTP body fix

- Store/Application/routes are async; MemoryStore kept as the no-DB fake
- PostgresStore with tenant transactions (app.current_org) and RLS policies
- migration 0002: omnilinks_app role, RLS on data-plane tables, signup idempotency unique index
- fix 0001: missing UNIQUE(id, organization_id) on conversations/workforce_members made the migration unappliable
- fix server: request bodies were never forwarded to the handler
- parity fixes: slug conflict 409, idempotency key reuse 422, malformed ids 404, workforce user must belong to tenant
- tests run against both stores; RLS, concurrency, HTTP and migration tests added
- CI runs a Postgres service
